'''Gen.G Esports''', (often abbreviated as '''Gen.G''' and officially short for ''Generation Gaming'', and formerly known as '''{{abbr|KSV|Korea + Silicon Valley}} eSports''') is a professional global esports organization based in Los Angeles and Seoul. They were ranked #8 in the 2022 Forbes list of the world’s most valuable esports companies. <ref name="The Most Valuable Esports Companies 2020">{{cite web|url=https://www.forbes.com/sites/brettknight/2022/05/06/the-most-valuable-esports-companies-2022/?sh=1be316bf599f|title=The Most Valuable Esports Companies 2022|author=Brett Knight|date=2022-05-06}}</ref>
